{"units": [{"i": 0, "p": 0, "t0": 0.0, "t1": 5.22, "text": "Nelayan tradisional di pesisir Indonesia berangkat melaut dini hari dan pulang siang hari.", "v0": 3.0, "v1": 8.22}, {"i": 1, "p": 0, "t0": 5.84, "t1": 10.82, "text": "Petani tembakau di Probolinggo justru cemas saat angin kering turun dari Pegunungan Tengger.", "v0": 8.84, "v1": 13.82}, {"i": 2, "p": 0, "t0": 11.35, "t1": 13.48, "text": "Keduanya berurusan dengan angin lokal.", "v0": 14.35, "v1": 16.48}, {"i": 3, "p": 1, "t0": 14.29, "t1": 24.04, "text": "Angin lokal, atau local wind, adalah angin yang terjadi karena perbedaan pemanasan dalam skala kecil, hanya beberapa puluh kilometer, dan berubah arah dalam sehari.", "v0": 17.29, "v1": 27.04}, {"i": 4, "p": 2, "t0": 24.72, "t1": 25.9, "text": "Kita mulai dari pantai.", "v0": 27.72, "v1": 28.9}, {"i": 5, "p": 2, "t0": 26.61, "t1": 29.74, "text": "Pada siang hari, daratan lebih cepat panas daripada laut.", "v0": 29.61, "v1": 32.74}, {"i": 6, "p": 2, "t0": 30.12, "t1": 32.69, "text": "Udara di atas daratan naik dan tekanannya turun.", "v0": 33.12, "v1": 35.69}, {"i": 7, "p": 2, "t0": 33.33, "t1": 35.75, "text": "Udara dari laut yang lebih sejuk bergerak ke darat.", "v0": 36.33, "v1": 38.75}, {"i": 8, "p": 2, "t0": 36.5, "t1": 42.02, "text": "Inilah angin laut, atau sea breeze, yang biasanya bertiup sekitar pukul sembilan pagi sampai empat sore.", "v0": 39.5, "v1": 45.02}, {"i": 9, "p": 3, "t0": 42.72, "t1": 44.72, "text": "Pada malam hari, keadaannya berbalik.", "v0": 45.72, "v1": 47.72}, {"i": 10, "p": 3, "t0": 45.18, "t1": 49.39, "text": "Daratan lebih cepat dingin, sehingga tekanan di darat lebih tinggi daripada di laut.", "v0": 48.18, "v1": 52.39}, {"i": 11, "p": 3, "t0": 49.96, "t1": 51.56, "text": "Angin bertiup dari darat ke laut.", "v0": 52.96, "v1": 54.56}, {"i": 12, "p": 3, "t0": 52.15, "t1": 56.74, "text": "Inilah angin darat, atau land breeze, sekitar pukul delapan malam sampai enam pagi.", "v0": 55.15, "v1": 59.74}, {"i": 13, "p": 4, "t0": 57.43, "t1": 59.26, "text": "Sekarang kamu tahu rahasia nelayan.", "v0": 60.43, "v1": 62.26}, {"i": 14, "p": 4, "t0": 59.55, "t1": 63.98, "text": "Mereka berangkat dini hari didorong angin darat, dan pulang siang hari didorong angin laut.", "v0": 62.55, "v1": 66.98}, {"i": 15, "p": 5, "t0": 64.96, "t1": 66.72, "text": "Pola yang mirip terjadi di pegunungan.", "v0": 67.96, "v1": 69.72}, {"i": 16, "p": 5, "t0": 67.32, "t1": 72.6, "text": "Pada siang hari, lereng gunung lebih cepat panas daripada udara di atas lembah pada ketinggian yang sama.", "v0": 70.32, "v1": 75.6}, {"i": 17, "p": 5, "t0": 73.24, "t1": 75.17, "text": "Udara naik dari lembah menyusuri lereng.", "v0": 76.24, "v1": 78.17}, {"i": 18, "p": 5, "t0": 75.87, "t1": 81.89, "text": "Inilah angin lembah, atau valley breeze, yang juga disebut angin anabatik, atau anabatic wind.", "v0": 78.87, "v1": 84.89}, {"i": 19, "p": 5, "t0": 82.56, "t1": 84.61, "text": "Pada malam hari, lereng cepat dingin.", "v0": 85.56, "v1": 87.61}, {"i": 20, "p": 5, "t0": 85.24, "t1": 87.54, "text": "Udara dingin yang berat mengalir turun ke lembah.", "v0": 88.24, "v1": 90.54}, {"i": 21, "p": 5, "t0": 87.84, "t1": 94.26, "text": "Inilah angin gunung, atau mountain breeze, yang disebut juga angin katabatik, atau katabatic wind.", "v0": 90.84, "v1": 97.26}, {"i": 22, "p": 5, "t0": 94.95, "t1": 100.04, "text": "Angin gunung inilah yang membuat udara dingin berkumpul di lembah dan kaldera pada malam hari.", "v0": 97.95, "v1": 103.04}, {"i": 23, "p": 6, "t0": 100.72, "t1": 105.5, "text": "Jenis berikutnya adalah angin jatuh, yaitu angin yang turun menuruni lereng pegunungan.", "v0": 103.72, "v1": 108.5}, {"i": 24, "p": 6, "t0": 106.08, "t1": 110.06, "text": "Ada yang panas dan kering, disebut angin fohn, atau foehn wind.", "v0": 109.08, "v1": 113.06}, {"i": 25, "p": 6, "t0": 110.7, "t1": 113.61, "text": "Udara lembap naik di lereng depan dan menurunkan hujan.", "v0": 113.7, "v1": 116.61}, {"i": 26, "p": 6, "t0": 114.22, "t1": 118.67, "text": "Setelah melewati puncak, udara yang sudah kering turun dan memanas di lereng belakang.", "v0": 117.22, "v1": 121.67}, {"i": 27, "p": 6, "t0": 119.05, "t1": 121.96, "text": "Perhitungan lengkapnya kita bahas di video efek fohn.", "v0": 122.05, "v1": 124.96}, {"i": 28, "p": 7, "t0": 122.52, "t1": 125.51, "text": "Indonesia punya banyak angin fohn dengan nama lokal.", "v0": 125.52, "v1": 128.51}, {"i": 29, "p": 7, "t0": 126.2, "t1": 133.29, "text": "Angin Gending di Probolinggo dan Pasuruan, turun dari Pegunungan Tengger pada Juli sampai September dan merusak tembakau.", "v0": 129.2, "v1": 136.29}, {"i": 30, "p": 7, "t0": 133.98, "t1": 135.89, "text": "Angin Kumbang di Cirebon dan Tegal.", "v0": 136.98, "v1": 138.89}, {"i": 31, "p": 7, "t0": 136.46, "t1": 137.81, "text": "Angin Brubu di Makassar.", "v0": 139.46, "v1": 140.81}, {"i": 32, "p": 7, "t0": 138.43, "t1": 142.46, "text": "Angin Bahorok di Deli, Sumatra Utara, yang merusak tembakau Deli.", "v0": 141.43, "v1": 145.46}, {"i": 33, "p": 7, "t0": 143.17, "t1": 144.99, "text": "Dan angin Wambraw di Biak, Papua.", "v0": 146.17, "v1": 147.99}, {"i": 34, "p": 8, "t0": 145.19, "t1": 149.63, "text": "Ada juga angin jatuh yang dingin, disebut angin bora, atau bora wind.", "v0": 148.19, "v1": 152.63}, {"i": 35, "p": 8, "t0": 149.94, "t1": 157.58, "text": "Contoh terkenalnya di pantai Laut Adriatik, ketika udara sangat dingin dari dataran tinggi meluncur turun ke pantai.", "v0": 152.94, "v1": 160.58}, {"i": 36, "p": 9, "t0": 158.29, "t1": 160.17, "text": "Sekarang, coba kerjakan soal ini.", "v0": 161.29, "v1": 163.17}, {"i": 37, "p": 10, "t0": 160.78, "t1": 165.59, "text": "Dini hari, daratan lebih dingin daripada laut, sehingga tekanan di darat lebih tinggi.", "v0": 167.78, "v1": 172.59}, {"i": 38, "p": 10, "t0": 166.18, "t1": 169.09, "text": "Angin bertiup dari darat ke laut, yaitu angin darat.", "v0": 173.18, "v1": 176.09}, {"i": 39, "p": 10, "t0": 169.6, "t1": 170.69, "text": "Jawabannya E.", "v0": 176.6, "v1": 177.69}, {"i": 40, "p": 11, "t0": 171.35, "t1": 172.32, "text": "Ada dua jebakan.", "v0": 178.35, "v1": 179.32}, {"i": 41, "p": 11, "t0": 172.87, "t1": 180.0, "text": "Pertama, angin laut bertiup dari laut ke darat, bukan sebaliknya, karena nama angin mengikuti asalnya.", "v0": 179.87, "v1": 187.0}, {"i": 42, "p": 11, "t0": 180.52, "t1": 186.57, "text": "Kedua, angin fohn itu kering dan panas, sedangkan angin bora dingin, walaupun keduanya sama-sama angin jatuh.", "v0": 187.52, "v1": 193.57}, {"i": 43, "p": 12, "t0": 187.2, "t1": 187.82, "text": "Ringkasnya:", "v0": 194.2, "v1": 194.82}, {"i": 44, "p": 12, "t0": 188.06, "t1": 195.37, "text": "angin laut siang dan angin darat malam, angin lembah siang dan angin gunung malam, serta angin fohn yang kering dan panas.", "v0": 195.06, "v1": 202.37}, {"i": 45, "p": 12, "t0": 196.04, "t1": 198.05, "text": "Berikutnya, kita naik ke skala dunia:", "v0": 203.04, "v1": 205.05}, {"i": 46, "p": 12, "t0": 198.42, "t1": 200.6, "text": "sirkulasi tiga sel dan angin pasat.", "v0": 205.42, "v1": 207.6}, {"i": 47, "p": 12, "t0": 201.08, "t1": 204.38, "text": "Latihan soalnya ada di O S N Geo titik I D.", "v0": 208.08, "v1": 211.38}], "words": [{"w": "Nelayan", "t": 3.0, "u": 0}, {"w": "tradisional", "t": 3.46, "u": 0}, {"w": "di", "t": 4.23, "u": 0}, {"w": "pesisir", "t": 4.38, "u": 0}, {"w": "Indonesia", "t": 4.84, "u": 0}, {"w": "berangkat", "t": 5.61, "u": 0}, {"w": "melaut", "t": 6.07, "u": 0}, {"w": "dini", "t": 6.53, "u": 0}, {"w": "hari", "t": 6.84, "u": 0}, {"w": "dan", "t": 7.15, "u": 0}, {"w": "pulang", "t": 7.3, "u": 0}, {"w": "siang", "t": 7.61, "u": 0}, {"w": "hari.", "t": 7.91, "u": 0}, {"w": "Petani", "t": 8.84, "u": 1}, {"w": "tembakau", "t": 9.31, "u": 1}, {"w": "di", "t": 9.93, "u": 1}, {"w": "Probolinggo", "t": 10.09, "u": 1}, {"w": "justru", "t": 10.71, "u": 1}, {"w": "cemas", "t": 11.02, "u": 1}, {"w": "saat", "t": 11.33, "u": 1}, {"w": "angin", "t": 11.64, "u": 1}, {"w": "kering", "t": 11.95, "u": 1}, {"w": "turun", "t": 1